---Additional details regarding the security posture of the device.
---@class gcp.androidmanagement_v1.PostureDetail
---@field securityRisk? gcp.androidmanagement_v1.PostureDetailSecurityRiskEnum|string A specific security risk that negatively affects the security posture of the device.
---@field advice? gcp.androidmanagement_v1.UserFacingMessageList Corresponding admin-facing advice to mitigate this security risk and improve the security posture of the device.

---@alias gcp.androidmanagement_v1.PostureDetailList gcp.androidmanagement_v1.PostureDetail[]

---@alias gcp.androidmanagement_v1.PostureDetailSecurityRiskEnum "SECURITY_RISK_UNSPECIFIED"|"UNKNOWN_OS"|"COMPROMISED_OS"|"HARDWARE_BACKED_EVALUATION_FAILED"

---A power management event.
---@class gcp.androidmanagement_v1.PowerManagementEvent
---@field eventType? gcp.androidmanagement_v1.PowerManagementEventEventTypeEnum|string Event type.
---@field createTime? string The creation time of the event.
---@field batteryLevel? number For BATTERY_LEVEL_COLLECTED events, the battery level as a percentage.

