---@field targets? gcp.androidmanagement_v1.TargetList Required. Targets that this rule applies to. This can have multiple targets here for convenience, and that is equivalent to having multiple rules in sequence each having one target, in the same order in which targets are listed here. This list must not be empty and must not have duplicates.
---@field predicate? gcp.androidmanagement_v1.Predicate Optional. The predicate of the rule, which can evaluate to true or false. See rules for how this is used. If not set, the predicate always evaluates to true.
---@field stages? gcp.androidmanagement_v1.RuleStagesItemEnumList Optional. The stages at which the rule is evaluated. If this list is empty, the rule is evaluated at all stages. Specifying stages is supported only for OS_UPDATE_WITHOUT_API_LEVEL_CHANGE and OS_UPDATE_WITH_API_LEVEL_CHANGE. For SINGLE_APP, GOOGLE_SYSTEM_SERVICES, and GOOGLE_PLAY_SYSTEM_UPDATE, this field is ignored and the rule is evaluated at all stages.

---@alias gcp.androidmanagement_v1.RuleList gcp.androidmanagement_v1.Rule[]

---@alias gcp.androidmanagement_v1.RuleStagesItemEnum "STAGE_UNSPECIFIED"|"STAGE_DOWNLOAD"|"STAGE_APPLY"

---@alias gcp.androidmanagement_v1.RuleStagesItemEnumList (gcp.androidmanagement_v1.RuleStagesItemEnum|string)[]

