---@field screenBrightness? number Optional. The screen brightness between 1 and 255 where 1 is the lowest and 255 is the highest brightness. A value of 0 (default) means no screen brightness set. Any other value is rejected. screenBrightnessMode must be either BRIGHTNESS_AUTOMATIC or BRIGHTNESS_FIXED to set this. Supported on Android 9 and above on fully managed devices. A NonComplianceDetail with API_LEVEL is reported if the Android version is less than 9. Supported on work profiles on company-owned devices on Android 15 and above.

---@alias gcp.androidmanagement_v1.ScreenBrightnessSettingsScreenBrightnessModeEnum "SCREEN_BRIGHTNESS_MODE_UNSPECIFIED"|"BRIGHTNESS_USER_CHOICE"|"BRIGHTNESS_AUTOMATIC"|"BRIGHTNESS_FIXED"

