---Configuration for managing system updatesNote: Google Play system updates (https://source.android.com/docs/core/ota/modular-system) (also called Mainline updates) are automatically downloaded but require a device reboot to be installed. Refer to the mainline section in Manage system updates (https://developer.android.com/work/dpc/system-updates#mainline) for further details.
---@class gcp.androidmanagement_v1.SystemUpdate
---@field startMinutes? number If the type is WINDOWED, the start of the maintenance window, measured as the number of minutes after midnight in the device's local time. This value must be between 0 and 1439, inclusive.
---@field type? gcp.androidmanagement_v1.SystemUpdateTypeEnum|string The type of system update to configure.
---@field freezePeriods? gcp.androidmanagement_v1.FreezePeriodList An annually repeating time period in which over-the-air (OTA) system updates are postponed to freeze the OS version running on a device. To prevent freezing the device indefinitely, each freeze period must be separated by at least 60 days.
---@field endMinutes? number If the type is WINDOWED, the end of the maintenance window, measured as the number of minutes after midnight in device's local time. This value must be between 0 and 1439, inclusive. If this value is less than start_minutes, then the maintenance window spans midnight. If the maintenance window specified is smaller than 30 minutes, the actual window is extended to 30 minutes beyond the start time.

---Information about a potential pending system update.
---@class gcp.androidmanagement_v1.SystemUpdateInfo
---@field updateReceivedTime? string The time when the update was first available. A zero value indicates that this field is not set. This field is set only if an update is available (that is, updateStatus is neither UPDATE_STATUS_UNKNOWN nor UP_TO_DATE).
---@field updateStatus? gcp.androidmanagement_v1.SystemUpdateInfoUpdateStatusEnum|string The status of an update: whether an update exists and what type it is.

---@alias gcp.androidmanagement_v1.SystemUpdateInfoUpdateStatusEnum "UPDATE_STATUS_UNKNOWN"|"UP_TO_DATE"|"UNKNOWN_UPDATE_AVAILABLE"|"SECURITY_UPDATE_AVAILABLE"|"OS_UPDATE_AVAILABLE"

---@alias gcp.androidmanagement_v1.SystemUpdateTypeEnum "SYSTEM_UPDATE_TYPE_UNSPECIFIED"|"AUTOMATIC"|"WINDOWED"|"POSTPONE"

